generic instantiation resolves the generic decl body's package-qualified references against the USE-SITE scope/alias-map instead of the generic's defining-file imports, so a body calling a package the consumer does not import emits a dangling symbol (undefined value @bn_dep__V) / mis-resolves to the wrong package (layout corruption for qualified field types). CRITICAL; checker+IR-gen both affected; pre-existing, NOT fixed by file-scoped imports (cf0d1cad). See claude-todo.md.
